        suffix. Target SNOMED CT 437738 = (214640008). Inherited via Athena from WHO V42.0 (concept_id
        45609496). Target captures the nontraffic (off-public-road) aspect but drops the collision
        counterparty (two-/three-wheeled motor vehicle), the driver role, and the Swedish activity
