    comment "en" """
        Source V4224 is a Swedish extension of ICD-10 V42.2 (car occupant, person on outside of vehicle,
        nontraffic collision with 2/3-wheeled motor vehicle) adding activity context SNOMED CT 214640008
        36198007. Parent V42.2 (Athena 45541989) has standard crosswalk SNOMED CT 437738 (Motor vehicle
        accident off public road, 214640008) and 444074 (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident,
        36198007). The Swedish activity suffix has no SNOMED CT analogue; the injury/accident semantics are
        identical to the parent. 437738 is the specific nontraffic-accident target (broader: drops
        car/2-3-wheel/outside detail + the activity). 444074 is the general vehicular-accident victim
        concept (broader still). Confidence for 437738 (verified Athena crosswalk on the parent,
        one-level broader); for 444074 (much broader fallback).
        """
}
